    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A traditional, two-storey townhouse occupying a prime location in the centre of Ardara town. In times past, this building comprised a shop plus a family home with two doors opening onto the Main Street. Presently, the building is one residence with accommodation consisting of two reception rooms, kitchen, four bedrooms and a bathroom. There is a large rear garden, offering ample room for an extension if desired. Vacant for a number of years, the building requires renovation and would qualify for a variety of improvement grants (subject to terms and conditions). Set in a superb town-centre location and offering great potential, early viewing is strongly recommended. All enquiries welcome."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "<br><br>\nHallway - 6.4m x 1.5m <br>Front door. \nBack door. \nWC off hall. <br><br><br>\nShop Area/Sitting Room - 3.7m x 3.7m <br>Two front windows; one window was a door leading to the street in times past. \nOpen fire. <br><br><br>\nDownstairs Bedroom/Office - 3.7m x 2m <br>Window overlooking rear garden. \nDoorway from shop area. \nCould easily be incorporated into business space. <br><br><br>\nLiving Room - 3.9m x 2.4m <br>Front window. \nSolid fuel range. <br><br><br>\nKitchen - 2m x 1.9m <br>Range of kitchen units. \nStainless steel sink.\nWindow overlooking back garden. <br><br><br>\nBedroom One - 3.7m x 3.7m <br>Front window. \nOpen fire. <br><br><br>\nBedroom Two - 3.7m x 2.4m <br>Front window. \nOpen fire. <br><br><br>\nBedroom Three - 3.7m x 2m <br>Window overlooking rear garden. <br><br><br>\nBathroom - 2.4m x 2m <br>WC, WHB and bath. \nContains hot press. <br><br>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Strictly by appointment"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Kee Henry"
      }
